  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 9.2.1:\n\n## Changed\n- The ImageSharp code built into the library was updated to version 2.1.11. (DOC-8057)\n- Updated the Japanese translations of messages. (DOC-7978)\n- The SBOM included in the package is now more complete and accurate. (DOC-7982, DOC-7984, DOC-8042, DOC-8098, DOC-8101, DOC-8102)\n- Updated third-party license notices. (DOC-7983, DOC-8044)\n- Updated the JPEG 2000 image decoder based on CoreJ2K. (DOC-8041)\n\n## Fixed\n- Fixed a potential stack overflow when a malformed, deeply nested license key was parsed (CVE-2024-21907). (DOC-8058)\n- Fixed an issue where `GcBitmap.Load` threw an exception (\"An attempt to read data beyond the end of the buffer\") for images whose EXIF metadata contained an invalid offset. (DOC-7965)\n- Fixed an issue where some glyphs in certain TrueType fonts, such as the digits 0 and 8, were rendered incorrectly. (DOC-7980)",
